WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
I truly recommend this academy because you can learn Spanish in a very fun and effective way.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
I decided to learn Spanish because I'd like to go travelling and to speak with people in Spanish language

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
in different countries and it's very exciting for me to learn a new language.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
What I like most of the classes is that they are very interactive

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
and Callan Method allow us to have a real conversation and learning not just grammar

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
but how to speak fluently in Spanish as we realize.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
I noticed a huge improvement.

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
At the beginning I liked to understand and respond quickly

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.000
but now I can keep a conversation fluid.
